  "summary_en": "Italy's 2022-2024 national AI strategy sets six objectives, eleven priority sectors and 24 policy initiatives across talent, research and applications, aligned with the EU AI Act and EU Coordinated Plan. It stresses human-centred, trustworthy AI, a regulatory sandbox, AI product certification support, and an interministerial steering group. Robotics appears only incidentally.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Six objectives, eleven priority sectors, three intervention areas with 24 initiatives funded largely via the NRRP",
   "Aligns with EU AI Act and adopts the EU Ethics Guidelines for Trustworthy AI",
   "Promotes Sperimentazione Italia regulatory sandbox for AI experimentation",
   "Creates a national governance system supporting certification of higher-risk AI products",
   "Establishes a permanent AI steering group within the Interministerial Committee for Digital Transition"
